        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-101" connectable="0" parent="xH5mV7unMsUPdfLFTdAY-229" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelPadding=2;labelBackgroundColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;labelBorderColor=#666666;" value="OLE DB DAX Query" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.0903" y="-1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint y="4" as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xH5mV7unMsUPdfLFTdAY-121" parent="b_-dq4IY0zQRH7gopXyB-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=18;spacing=5;fontColor=#333333;glass=0;shadow=0;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How it Works&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The semantic model provides the active Financial Entity population and associated hierarchy attributes to Excel using a DAX query over OLE DB.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Users classify each Financial Entity at an appropriate aggregation grain, with the selected hierarchy value automatically converted into a proposed modelling case.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Where required, a controlled override allows bespoke portfolio groupings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;The workbook provides immediate feedback on the number of Financial Entities, resulting modelling cases, overrides and aggregation methods used.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;The completed mapping is then re-ingested through Power Query and joined back to the financial profile dataset using Financial Entity Key.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="343.21" width="350" x="473" y="119.79000000000002" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-94" connectable="0" parent="b_-dq4IY0zQRH7gopXyB-1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="153" width="820" x="21.25" y="1024" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-91" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-94" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=13;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingBottom=0;fontColor=default;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13gqmb9&quot; data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Controlled translation: &lt;/b&gt;defined rules map Financial Entities to modelling cases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13gqmb9&quot; data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source traceability: &lt;/b&gt;modelling cases remain traceable to originating Financial Entities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13gqmb9&quot; data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Human accountability: &lt;/b&gt;users explicitly define and review case mappings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13gqmb9&quot; data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Complete population: &lt;/b&gt;validation identifies unmapped or incomplete entity assignments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="123" width="410" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-92" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-94" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=13;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=default;fontStyle=0;spacingBottom=0;" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qfg7&quot; data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consistent classification: &lt;/b&gt;standard attributes support repeatable case construction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qfg7&quot; data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stable identity:&lt;/b&gt; Financial Entity keys preserve identity through translation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qfg7&quot; data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Transparent overrides: &lt;/b&gt;user-defined grouping and naming remain explicit and reviewable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qfg7&quot; data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Separation of concerns: &lt;/b&gt;source hierarchy is preserved independently of modelling structure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="123" width="410" x="410" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-93" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-94" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=15;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Design Principles&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
