        <mxCell id="YbqmEhzo_ljBbs4Gu1zp-180" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-90" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=5;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;fillColor=#bac8d3;strokeColor=#23445d;verticalAlign=top;spacingBottom=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=default;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Governed Modelling Dataset&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;The resulting semantic model provides a consistent, controlled dataset for extraction into the Excel scenario modeller." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="158.5" width="180" x="660" y="791.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-82" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-90" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=13;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingBottom=0;fontColor=default;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13gqmb9&quot; data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;795&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;Single governed data layer:&lt;/strong&gt; system and approved manual data converge into a common modelling structure&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13gqmb9&quot; data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;904&quot; data-end=&quot;933&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Standardised integration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; common dimensions and metrics support consistent downstream treatment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13gqmb9&quot; data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1006&quot; data-end=&quot;1032&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Controlled derivation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; calculated modelling metrics are generated through defined transformation logic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13gqmb9&quot; data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1115&quot; data-end=&quot;1139&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Source traceability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; data provenance is retained across system and manual inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="410.00000000000006" x="20" y="1028" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-83" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-90" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=13;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=default;fontStyle=0;spacingBottom=0;" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 10px; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qfg7&quot; data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1202&quot; data-end=&quot;1229&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Data quality by design:&lt;/strong&gt; structured preparation and validation reduce inconsistent downstream data&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4r2jjc&quot; data-start=&quot;1304&quot; data-end=&quot;1406&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1333&quot;&gt;Separation of concerns:&lt;/strong&gt; data preparation is separated from scenario modelling and user decisions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;heh7et&quot; data-start=&quot;1407&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1409&quot; data-end=&quot;1437&quot;&gt;Reusable modelling data:&lt;/strong&gt; the semantic layer provides a consistent source for multiple analytical uses&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zr3x7q&quot; data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1544&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Governed extensibility:&lt;/strong&gt; additional approved data can be integrated through controlled structures&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="410.00000000000006" x="430" y="1028" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-84" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-90" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#d6b656;fillColor=#fff2cc;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=15;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Design Principles&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="820.0000000000001" x="20" y="998" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-89" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-90" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=18;spacing=10;fontColor=#333333;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="10" width="820" x="20" y="969" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-103" connectable="0" parent="udcwdMiNgaylk7ucZYJF-1" style="group" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1213" width="1000" x="3195" y="112" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xH5mV7unMsUPdfLFTdAY-7" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-103" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=20;align=left;spacing=10;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1" value="&lt;div&gt;Controlled Manual Profile Integration&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Standardised templates extend system-sourced financial profiles while preserving dimensional integrity, traceability and reusable ingestion logic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1194.5" width="1000" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xH5mV7unMsUPdfLFTdAY-48" parent="fhdA6c5ZEEW-gf_SAT2R-103" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=18;spacing=5;fontColor=#333333;glass=0;shadow=0;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;How it Works&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Each approved workbook is registered from the controlled SharePoint folder and assigned a surrogate Financial Entity key.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;A reusable Power Query function extracts and standardises the financial profile, while a second function extracts controlled metadata from defined workbook names.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The profile is transformed to the same transaction schema as SAP-sourced data, while the metadata is aligned and appended to the Financial Entity dimension.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193)); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Both are then processed through the same downstream mapping and scenario logic as system-sourced records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="420" width="260" x="370.0000000000002" y="512" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
